teacher_info.teaching_style:
I L-O-V-E the Communicative Approach and I usually combine it with the Lexical approach, which means: 
❥ we speak a lot; 
❥ we practice real-life communication; 
❥ we don't do too many grammar exercises; 
❥ we listen to native speakers and watch videos; 
❥ your vocabulary range grows rapidly; 
❥ we have fun and enjoy ourselves! 😀
